  "name": {
    "zh": "mos_雨滴",
    "en": "mos_rain"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "真实雨天玻璃窗：支持自定义图层按亮度或 Alpha 提取轮廓，把自定义光照与边缘套用液态折射、三通道色散与弯月面高光；也内置大雨滴、小雨滴与粘滑流动长条雨滴，可单独或融合使用。",
    "en": "Realistic rain on window glass: supports a custom map layer extracted by Luminance or Alpha to derive liquid contours and lighting for convex refraction, 3-channel dispersion and meniscus specular shading, plus built-in procedural large drops, small drops and flowing streaks."
  },
